From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 23:58:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ActiveAE: hand a late start over to the clock in whole vsyncs

A late start plays and is left to the player's clock, which bands the
move to one content frame under a vsync adjust and skips it below
100 ms under a speed adjust. Part of a vsync also shifts the clock sync
phase. A late start measured while muted can be skipped unheard; one
already heard keeps the phase only when moved in whole vsyncs.
